    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35032" root="قب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِبَّةُ الشَّاةِ</span></b> , also pronounced without teshdeed
[i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِبَة</span>], <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفِث</span> [q. v.] <i>of the sheep</i> or <i>goat,</i>
(S, O, K,) <i>which has</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَطْبَاق</span>, [see, again, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفِثٌ</span>,]
(S, O,) <i>and which is the receptacle whereto the
feces of the stomach finally pass.</i> (TA.) [See
also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وقب</span>.]

